  "reference": "diff-diff 4.0.0 (ContinuousDiD with survey_design=SurveyDesign(weights=...), no covariates): the lowest-dose comparison with a continuous and a discrete dose on the lowest-dose panel weighted by cell size, and three cohorts with never-treated and not-yet-treated comparisons on the covariate panel with weights 1 + (id mod 7) / 2. Estimates, curves, cells and the event study are compared directly. diff-diff's weighted standard errors apply each unit's weight twice (upstream-issues, issue 6); the tests check the standard errors against the dense oracle, and reproduce diff-diff's from the oracle's per-unit scores with the weight applied again.",
